  "instructions": [
    "Season the sea bass fillets with salt, pepper, and ginger.",
    "Heat olive oil in a saucepan and sauté onion and garlic until fragrant.",
    "Add sliced carrot, wine, and bay leaf, then pour in fish stock and bring to a simmer.",
    "Allow the broth to simmer for 10 minutes to develop flavor.",
    "Add the sea bass fillets, cover, and cook for 8 to 10 minutes until the fish is opaque.",
    "Stir in fresh spinach and lemon juice, and simmer for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Taste the soup and adjust seasoning with salt, pepper, or more lemon juice if desired.",
    "Serve hot in a slate tile bowl for a light, detoxifying meal."
